  "problem": "Find the characteristic equation of the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 2 \\\\ -8 & -6\\end{aligned}].$",
  "worked_solution": "First, we find the matrix $\\,A-\\lambda I:$\n\ufeff\ufeff\ufeff\n\n$$\nA-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}2-\\lambda  & 2 \\\\ -8 & -6-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThen, the characteristic equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}2-\\lambda  & 2 \\\\ -8 & -6-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (2-\\lambda )(-6-\\lambda )-(-8)\\cdot 2 & =0 \\\\ -12-2\\lambda +6\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}+16 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}+4\\lambda +4 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
